oleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":1930991898,"text":"彼らを放っておいたら、「祟り神」の力はいずれに制御不能になり、この島も、島にいる俺たちも上空まで吹き飛ばされるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[721150112]},{"nodeId":721150112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":1768505634,"text":"だがもしファデュイだけに注意力を注いでいたら、バリアに蓄積していた「祟り神」も、いずれに限界に達してしまう…","nextNodeIds":[721150113]},{"nodeId":721150113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":658889826,"text":"じゃあ、両方を同時に解決するしかない？","nextNodeIds":[721150114]},{"nodeId":721150114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":2769973474,"text":"ああ…分かりやすく言おう。学術的なものと客観的な観点で言えば…","nextNodeIds":[721150115]},{"nodeId":721150115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":2682621330,"text":"今の状況、ファデュイと「祟り神」、この二つの問題が突きつけられている。","nextNodeIds":[721150116]},{"nodeId":721150116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":2980668698,"text":"だが、「御影炉心」の中の現状を見るに、一つの問題を解決しようと行動してる時、もう一つの問題が壁となる可能性が非常に高い。","nextNodeIds":[721150117]},{"nodeId":721150117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":3729882018,"text":"だから、いま直面している現実は…","nextNodeIds":[721150118]},{"nodeId":721150118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2848098314,"text":"やるしかない。","nextNodeIds":[721150119]},{"nodeId":721150119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":4025893498,"text":"えっと、そう、そうだ。俺たちは両方を同時に解決するしかない。","nextNodeIds":[721150120]},{"nodeId":721150120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":1526137986,"text":"だが一歩ずつ進もう。「急がば回れ」、璃月人はよくそう言うだろう。","nextNodeIds":[721150121]},{"nodeId":721150121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3979949954,"text":"璃月のことわざを知ってるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[721150122]},{"nodeId":721150122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":3039635450,"text":"前に璃月に行ったことがある。これは旅の小さな記念品だ。","nextNodeIds":[721150123]},{"nodeId":721150123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":1456689954,"text":"このような記念品はまだたくさんある。モンドの記念品はもう飲み干したけど…味は最高だった。","nextNodeIds":[721150124]},{"nodeId":721150124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":4058683378,"text":"さて、本題に入ろう。「御影炉心」の件を解決するため、一つ提案がある。お前に協力してほしい。","nextNodeIds":[721150125,721150127]},{"nodeId":721150125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2263423530,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[721150126]},{"nodeId":721150126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":3286305666,"text":"ははっ！俺はお前みたいな…まっすぐな性格をしたやつは好きだぜ、助かる！","nextNodeIds":[721150131]},{"nodeId":721150131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":4020585674,"text":"コホン、本題に戻ろう。この「探測ビーコン」を持っていってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[721150132]},{"nodeId":721150132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":2647201050,"text":"そして、「探測ビーコン」を何ヶ所かに分けて設置してほしい。","nextNodeIds":[721150133]},{"nodeId":721150133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":546234114,"text":"このビーコンは「御影炉心」内の「祟り神」の力の濃度と分布データを集めることができる。それらのデータがあれば、より詳しい計画を立てることが可能だ。","nextNodeIds":[721150134,721150136]},{"nodeId":721150134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1994263202,"text":"任せて。","nextNodeIds":[721150135]},{"nodeId":721150135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":597352786,"text":"では、頼んだ。","nextNodeIds":[721150141]},{"nodeId":721150141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":948497410,"text":"設置する場所はマップに記しておこう、頼んだよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721150136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4263277890,"text":"このビーコン、いったいどんな原理で…","nextNodeIds":[721150137]},{"nodeId":721150137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":2162518754,"text":"それは…元素力原理をもとに、各種のエネルギーを定量化及び計算をする機械だ。","nextNodeIds":[721150138]},{"nodeId":721150138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":4149280266,"text":"「簡単に説明すると」って…言いたいところだが、この動作原理は簡単には説明できない。そうだ、七つの元素からまず説明しよう！それは…","nextNodeIds":[721150139]},{"nodeId":721150139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1913015138,"text":"だ、大丈夫。","nextNodeIds":[721150140]},{"nodeId":721150140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":1092158906,"text":"そうか、分かった。","nextNodeIds":[721150141]},{"nodeId":721150127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3994857666,"text":"何かメリットはある？","nextNodeIds":[721150128]},{"nodeId":721150128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":1379504218,"text":"メリットは…この島にあるまだ発見されてない宝物と、「御影炉心」の中にある「欠片」だ。","nextNodeIds":[721150129]},{"nodeId":721150129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":3238331818,"text":"ほら、稲妻で最大の製錬施設として、「御影炉心」の中にはきっと…うん…目を見張るべきものがある。","nextNodeIds":[721150130]},{"nodeId":721150130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":2828722418,"text":"もちろん！「神の目」を持っていない俺は、「御影炉心」に入ることすらできないから、その中の状況は分からないが。","nextNodeIds":[721150131]},{"nodeId":721150106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1903268402,"text":"悪いお知らせ。","nextNodeIds":[721150107]},{"nodeId":721150107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":3225523178,"text":"悪いお知らせは、ファデュイのヤツらがまだ「御影炉心」の中で暴れてることだ。","nextNodeIds":[721150108]},{"nodeId":721150108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":2808864370,"text":"彼らは「祟り神」の核心を手に入れる方法を探し続けてる。","nextNodeIds":[721150109]},{"nodeId":721150109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":3733514978,"text":"で、いいお知らせは、現在の炉心の破損状況が思ったほど深刻ではなくて、まだ俺に処理できる範囲内だったことだ…","nextNodeIds":[721150110]},{"nodeId":721150110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":4289991802,"text":"でも明らかに、ファデュイのヤツらはこのいい知らせをよく思ってない。","nextNodeIds":[721150111]}]},{"talkId":7211502,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7211502","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["7211508","1","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_QUEST_NOT_RECEIVE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay