":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":2111413914,"text":"コホン、それでなんだが…しばらくしたら、ビーコンの回収もお前にお願いするかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[721150313]},{"nodeId":721150313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":3606941722,"text":"このグザヴィエは「神の目」を持っていない。だから、「祟り神」のエネルギーが満ちた場所には自由に出入りできないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[721150314]},{"nodeId":721150314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":37643618,"text":"それに、中には…乱暴なファデュイもいる。この島で、この二つの問題を同時に扱える人はお前しかないと思う。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721150308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1371862522,"text":"このビーコンは売り物？","nextNodeIds":[721150309]},{"nodeId":721150309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":298108746,"text":"冗談はよしてくれ。ビーコンの値段はさておき、お前に売ってしまったら俺が困る…","nextNodeIds":[721150310]},{"nodeId":721150310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","textMapHash":3916879330,"text":"もし今後フォンテーヌに行くことがあるなら、ビーコンを売っている人を何人か紹介しよう。結構いい値段がするけど。","nextNodeIds":[721150311]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7211503,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133213108,3"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INIT_TIME_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3162","SELECT_NPC_NONE"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7211501,7211502,7211503],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3162,"speakerName":"グザヴィエ","